staticjs's src/math.c ports V8's fdlibm (src/base/ieee754.cc of V8
12.4.254.21), which derives from fdlibm; its cbrt is FreeBSD's s_cbrt.c,
fdlibm's as Bruce D. Evans rewrote it, under the same notice. V8's own
notice for its changes is in LICENSE.v8.

